{{trans-bottom}}

=====Derived terms=====
* [[tiller extension]]

===Etymology 3===
From Old English ''[[telgor]]'' “small branch”

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{obsolete}} A young [[tree]].

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{intransitive}} To put forth new [[shoot]]s.

